  🔙 tutorials │ 📚 kit's applications

  kit's applications — kit has an application for each side of the work, from Flow, the trip of the work from an issue
  to a release, to Packages

  Each application shows one side of the work in this repository. Each part below names one, and ends with the command
  that prints it.

  Flow

  The whole trip of the work, from an issue to a release, one stage to a tab. Open Flow, or its Issues.

  kit flow

  Issues

  The work to do: the backlog, and the issues underway.

  kit flow issues

  Changes

  The pull requests, each with its build.

  kit flow changes
